  "name": "Sales Return Order Assistant DSHRZ",
  "description": "Our AI-assisted return assistant enhances customer service operations by automating the sales order return process. It intelligently retrieves order details, evaluates each item for return eligibility, and guides representatives through available return options. If an item is not eligible, clear messaging is provided. Upon selection of return preferences, the assistant seamlessly generates and presents the return order for final approval, ensuring speed, accuracy, and an improved customer experience.",
